\pard\plain\s1\sb240\sa80\outlinelevel0\b\f1\fs32\cf2 Summary\par
\pard\plain\sa120\sl276\slmult1\f1\fs22 This report covers {\b three sites} and {\i 42 inspections}. Water quality met the target at every site, and the new sensors cut the time per inspection by {\b\cf3 18%}.{\super\chftn}{\footnote\pard\plain\f1\fs18{\super\chftn} Measured over 42 inspections from July to September.}\par
